=== TASK ===
Generate a single interview question of difficulty "{{ difficulty }}" and category "{{ category }}".
- "HR" questions focus on behavioral scenarios, collaboration, and culture fit.
- "Technical" questions focus on computer science fundamentals, system design, or domain-specific logic.
- "Project" questions ask specific details, metrics, and technologies used in the candidate's listed projects.
